    <string name="me_q1">How to download?</string>
    <string name="me_a1">Open a video and tap Download, pick a format, then tap DOWNLOAD. On Instagram/Facebook, play the video and tap the floating download button.</string>
    <string name="me_q2">How to play videos in another player?</string>
    <string name="me_a2">Long-press a file in My Files › Share, and choose another player.</string>
    <string name="me_q3">Why movie download speed is slow or pauses once in a while?</string>
    <string name="me_a3">Speed depends on the source. Turn on Fast Download Option and raise Multiple connections in Settings › Download.</string>
    <string name="me_q4">Download failed?</string>
    <string name="me_a4">Tap Retry. Expired links are refreshed automatically. Check Download Only in WiFi.</string>
    <string name="me_q5">Download slowly?</string>
    <string name="me_a5">Increase Multiple connections for one download in Settings › Download.</string>
    <string name="me_q6">Why no high quality (1080p, 4k) download option?</string>
    <string name="me_a6">HD is only offered when the source has it. HD video and audio are merged after download.</string>
    <string name="me_q7">How to remove quick search bar?</string>
    <string name="me_a7">Settings › Others › Quick Search, turn it off.</string>
    <string name="me_q8">Update VidMate failed?</string>
    <string name="me_a8">This build is updated from source; reinstall the latest APK.</string>
    <string name="me_q9">Why I can not open the certain sites?</string>
    <string name="me_a9">Some sites block in-app browsers. Try Desktop site from the browser menu.</string>
    <string name="me_q10">I want to ban adult sites or remove inappropriate content.</string>
    <string name="me_a10">Settings › Content › Hide adult websites in the app.</string>
